    2. Pick a single fg color from 1-9
    3. Generate a random 4-connected object with bbox height h in [2,7], width w in [3,6]
    4. Place object so all margins >= 1; left_margin >= 1 (some clipping OK)
    5. Ensure fg pixel count < total/2 (bg must dominate)
    6. Apply shear transform to derive output
```
